    },
    "人站在这个地点时点「设为当前位置」。范围是进出算到达和离开的距离。只存在这台 iPhone 上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stand at the place and tap “Use current location.” The radius is how far counts as arriving and leaving. Stays on this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天还没切过 mode。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No mode switches yet today."
